cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these notebooks, please cite them as below."
title: "IRISCC VRE — Wildfires in Europe: Jupyter notebooks for ACTRIS, IAGOS, ICOS and FLEXPART data"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/actris-ares/iriscc-vre-wildfires"
abstract: >-
  Jupyter notebooks that follow a wildfire episode - the 2025 Canadian fire season and the
  transport of its smoke to Europe - across the ACTRIS, IAGOS and ICOS research
  infrastructures, together with FLEXPART model output. Built for Demonstrator 6 of the
  Horizon Europe project IRISCC and run on the D4Science virtual research environment
  "Wildfires in Europe".
keywords:
  - wildfires
  - aerosol
  - lidar
  - aerosol typing
  - ACTRIS
  - IAGOS
  - ICOS
  - FLEXPART
  - IRISCC
  - virtual research environment
  - Jupyter
